ved, from #inc-vtg-hartford:\n\nSubject: Hartford gate kiosk incident summary\n\nHi Mateo,\n\nHere is a short summary of the Hartford gate kiosk incident:\n- Kiosks went offline on August 3, 2026, with both inbound lanes showing a white screen after badge scan.\n- Both lanes were working again as of August 3, 11:07.\n- Your status-page access issue is tracked in ticket INC-4821.\n\nLet me know if you need anything else.\n\nBest,\nGideon","id":2,"source":"assistant, #strategic-pod, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"Gideon Sato (gideon-sato, Strategic account manager) wrote in #strategic-pod on 2026-10-14 09:00: Can you draft a short mail from me to Mateo Quiroga at Vantorre with the Hartford gate kiosk incident summary from #inc-vtg-hartford: the day the kiosks went offline, when both lanes were back, and the ticket that tracks his status-page access? A draft only, I will send it.","id":1,"source":"gideon-sato, #strategic-pod, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ruth-calloway"}
